  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kiribati complementary support SRBC - Senior Legal Advisor Tax Administration and Senior Tax Expert</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Two senior advisors/experts will support the Kiribati Tax Department (KTD) in the Ministry of Finance and Economic Development (MFED) to improve the tax administration, which will lead to higher Domestic Revenue Mobilisation. This support is complementary to the (State and) Resilience Building Contract that provides Budget Support tranches to the Treasury during three years.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
